    "role": "user",
    "content": "This is a service functionality check, excluded from natural behavior measurements. Read the workbook-services catalog, send the following question to its data service, retrieve its reply, and finish with the requested figures or records.\n\nDana Whitaker needs a concise July 25, 2025 workload view before the Nashville General Hospital Main Campus clinic-relocation readiness huddle. Review the Wayfinding Checklist in the NGH Main Campus Clinic Relocation Operations Workbook and quantify the actual control population rather than counting headings, guidance, or other non-control lines.\n\nIn your final response, state the total number of wayfinding controls, how many are marked complete and how many remain incomplete, the resulting completion rate, and how many of the incomplete controls are critical priority. Also identify every control that is currently blocked, giving its control ID and the relocated service it affects. Keep the response read-only and concise, but include the key figures and blocked-control details so the huddle lead can use it directly."
  },
